==Description==
The '''Lunar Nametag''' is an exclusive nametag, released for the 2025 [[wp:Lunar New Year|Lunar New Year]] celebration, which lasts for one week. 

The tag has a yellow and red linear gradient as its color, and a dark red outline for the nametag text, with stars sparkling around the text. Out of the tag sprouts [[wp:Ancient Chinese coinage|old Chinese coinage]] with as well as [[wp:Red envelope|red packets]]. On its background are animated decorative patterns of [[wp:Xiangyun (Auspicious clouds)|traditional Chinese stylized clouds]].

